<p>You gain 25% absolute damage resistance and 25% all damage penetration.  Each time you are struck by a weapon these bonuses are reduced by 5% but fully recovered after 8 turns.</p><p>Additionally, you gain 70% of the highest of your Magic or Dexterity stat as defense (<acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Dexterity 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>Magic 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">7, 17, 35, 52, 70</acronym>)</p>